{"id":"080e5a6c2d99d959","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology.md","title":"Definition — Topology Generated by a Pretopology","display":"Definition — Topology Generated by a Pretopology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology","aliases":["14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology"],"display":"Definition — Topology Generated by a Pretopology","depends_on":["[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-sieve]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Topology Generated by a Pretopology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de8df30671642cb0\" href=\"?note=de8df30671642cb0\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-pretopology\">14-df-grothendieck-pretopology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是有拉回的小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de8df30671642cb0\" href=\"?note=de8df30671642cb0\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-pretopology\">14-df-grothendieck-pretopology</a> 的前拓扑公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上的筛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nJ_K(C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\land\\exists R\\in K(C)\\ (R\\subseteq S)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsPretopology}(K,\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_K,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nJ_K(C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\land\\exists R\\in K(C)\\ (R\\subseteq S)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsPretopology}(K,\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_K,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2。极大筛含恒等覆盖族。拉回覆盖族中的每支箭头，所得覆盖族含在原覆盖筛的逆像内，故稳定。对局部性，先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 内的一覆盖族，再对每个该族箭头的逆像筛选取覆盖族，复合前拓扑公理把它们拼成含在目标筛中的覆盖族。这也证明本构造是使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的覆盖族覆盖的最小 Grothendieck 拓扑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-pretopology","status":"resolved","id":"de8df30671642cb0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-pretopology","status":"resolved","id":"de8df30671642cb0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是有拉回的小范畴，$K$ 满足 [[14-df-grothendieck-pretopology]] 的前拓扑公理。$C$ 是对象，$S$ 是 $C$ 上的筛。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nJ_K(C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\land\\exists R\\in K(C)\\ (R\\subseteq S)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsPretopology}(K,\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_K,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1381,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology|Definition — Topology Generated by a Pretopology]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topology-generated-by-pretopology|Definition — Topology Generated by a Pretopology]]"}],"outgoing":["de8df30671642cb0","3fcbbf29a7947555","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5"]}